# Mac only. Stowed by `stow local-mac`.
#
# Deliberately empty of aliases. claude, opencode and codex are native binaries
# already on PATH here, so the short forms in the shared .zshrc reach them with
# nothing to redirect — unlike the WSL box, which has no Linux build and points
# the full names at .exe paths. The rest of this package is
# ~/.config/tmux-sessionizer/paths.
